@startuml
title Top up a wallet | FR-008/010 | BR-027–032 | SePay Payment Gateway
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
actor "Wallet owner" as U
participant SkillSwap as S
participant "SePay Payment Gateway" as P
participant Wallet as W
U -> S: Choose an amount in VND to add to the wallet
S -> S: Create the top-up request with a unique invoice number
S -> P: Submit the signed checkout form
P --> S: Redirect to the hosted checkout page
S --> U: Return the hosted checkout URL
U -> P: Open the checkout page and pay
P -> S: IPN: order paid (invoice number correlates the request)
S -> S: Authenticate by source IP and find the top-up request
alt Unknown invoice, replayed, or amount does not match
 S --> P: Acknowledge without changing the wallet again
else Payment completed
 S -> W: Add credits once and record the wallet history
 S -> S: Update the top-up status and record the provider's settlement facts
 S --> P: Top-up applied
else Payment reversed
 S -> W: Record an offsetting wallet deduction once
 S -> S: Update the top-up status
 S --> P: Reversal applied
end
P -> S: Browser returns to the success URL
S --> U: Acknowledge only, credits nothing
note over S,W: 1 credit = 1,000 VND.\nWallet changes and top-up status are saved separately in current code.
note over S,P: Authenticity is the payment provider's IP allow-list plus the invoice lookup;\nthe notification carries no signature and no secret header (ADR-033).
@enduml
